# Phase 27 plan 03 fixture (D-35): minimal healthy tmux -CC attach.
# The %begin/%end greeting block tmux emits on connect, then the
# session-changed notification for the attached session.
<< %begin 1700000000 1 0
<< %end 1700000000 1 0
<< %session-changed $1 work
# Hold the connection open so supervisor tests can assert steady state
# deterministically; ctx cancel ends playback before the line below is
# ever emitted (and the parser would skip it as unknown anyway).
@delay 30s
<< %test-hold-open
